f the wrongdoers.\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":58,"sd":null},{"k":"6:59","t":"And with Him are the keys of the unseen; none knows them except Him. And He knows what is on the land and in the sea. Not a leaf falls but that He knows it. And no grain is there within the darknesses of the earth and no moist or dry [thing] but that it is [written] in a clear record.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":59,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":14,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}